  "title": "AGTTM Part 10 - Supporting Guidance",
  "abstract": "AGTTM Part 10 provides supplementary guidance supporting the broader AGTTM series. It addresses specialized topics and complex scenarios not fully covered in other parts, including works on freeways, motorways, and high-speed roads. The guide covers incident management, special events traffic management, emergency works, and unique situations requiring tailored approaches. It provides additional risk assessment frameworks, review and inspection procedures, and road safety audit guidance.",
